BT /F1 10 Tf 50 615 Td (Customer data shall be retained, backed up, and archived by Vendor for a period of ten \(10\) years following contract termination, regardless of applicable statutory data minimization standards. Customer agrees that data purging requests shall be subject to administrative processing fees.) Tj ET
